# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# Without this, Git converts to CRLF on checkout here and every file shows up
# as modified on another machine. Pinned at the first commit so the history
# never needs a line-ending rewrite later.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets that must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
